Local run, 15 November 2026, on the development machine (not GitHub Actions), after the fixes from the
independent review. TreeSearch was built from its GitHub source (development version 1.8.0.9001) with its
tree-distance and rogue-taxon dependencies removed, because those packages could not be installed here;
the scoring code (Morphy) is unchanged. The official run uses TreeSearch from CRAN in GitHub Actions
and writes crosscheck.log when these files reach main.

